Package: netrunneR
Title: Offline Mirror and Analysis Toolkit for Netrunner Card-Game Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Marcus", "Morrisey", email = "marcus.morrisey@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Maintains an offline, versioned mirror of Netrunner card-game
    data sources (NetrunnerDB, AlwaysBeRunning, the community cardpool
    repository, the Jinteki implementation repository and the Comprehensive
    Rules hub) with per-lineage fetch and build dispatch, a shared
    atomic promote/validate/ledger pipeline, and derived ratings,
    matchup and tournament-meta views shared by a scheduled sync container
    and a Shiny app.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
